      "content": "rest? i don't know if i can just rest. it feels like the only way to actually stop the hurting is to just... stop existing. like, everything is so dark, Kaelen. even if i try to build something new, the shadow of what i lost follows me. it feels more like a curse than a life. does it ever just end? the pain, i mean?",
